<div class="tk-cj-section-head"><span class="tk-ip-kicker">ONE CONNECTED CUSTOMER STORY</span><h2>See what happened after the click.</h2><p>Explore an illustrative journey below. Select any event to inspect why it belongs in the story and what evidence supports the relationship.</p></div>
